{"name":"12-2-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"background","value":"2019summer_7","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Data transfer initiated."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Banana, who has been resting peacefully in SOP-II's arms, suddenly starts kicking its stubby legs violently... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As if to escape from something terrifying."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Banana doesn't seem too stable... Is it because of the massive file size?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It is, after all, just an external device – its processing speed simply can't compare with that of a Doll. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Its core is probably overheating due to its low decoding efficiency. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At this rate, its circuitry might just burn up."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What?! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"NOOOO! Banana... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Auuu...."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop crying... Even if it's kaput, we can just catch another one for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It won't be the same! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Not only has Banana carried your neural cloud, it was also modified by Persica. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I even gave it a paint job that matches you! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Banana is irreplaceable to me!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks to that, I'm forced to relive all those bad memories every time I see it... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you don't shut up already, I might end up destroying the Dinergate myself..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Commander","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dandelion, what do you propose?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Have a Doll take over some of the decoding work from the Dinergate. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Decoding all the data is the most demanding part of the process. Once that's done, all that's left is accessing the information. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Dinergate is more than enough to handle that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood. Leave that to me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, let me do it. I do specialize in this kind of stuff. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Besides, your neural cloud is required for issuing commands and storing other neural clouds, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO has a point. You should preserve your valuable processing capacity while we're still on standby."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So you're volunteering to save Banana, RO?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... (Looks away silently)."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well? Why aren't you saying anything?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Also, Commander, I might be a little presumptuous here... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But there's something I believe should be done."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Commander","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia is storing all the backup copies of the Griffin Dolls within her own neural cloud storage. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Since I have an active connexion with her, I've been supporting her computation. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, the amount of data really is tremendous. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So to make more space, I would like to transfer all memory fragments regarding Lunasia onto the Dinergate."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Memories about me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia has been forced to make countless difficult decisions in the past, which has put her under immense pressure. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I hope you can understand her better and help ease her guilt and distress. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So I would like you to go through these memories using an external device."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Commander","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"These are M4's memories. I will not pry into them without her consent."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is what she desires. I am simply expressing it for her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4 looks down as if to steel herself."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No... Actually, she's right, Commander... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Dandelion just spoke my mind for me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I once made everyone suffer for my weakness and naivety. These memories hold nothing but indescribable pain for me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But...even so, I still want you to know me better, Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In order to avoid making the same mistakes again, I want to understand myself better too."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4, is this really okay? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After all, what happened also made you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's fine, 15. Avoiding the problem will only deepen the shadow it casts. Besides, there's nothing to hide from the Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"RO, please go ahead and extract the relevant data. I want to express myself to the Commander and all of you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She said as much. It's her decision."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"15... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Understood, I'll take care of it then."}]}]}]}
